  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and standard deviation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math>&nbsp;observations were calculated as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> respectively. It was found that by mistake one data value was taken as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math> instead of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt></math> are the mean and standard deviation respectively for correct data, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Mean <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>19</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>19</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>19</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>175</mn></math></p><p>New mean <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>19</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>175</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>S.D. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1500</mn></math></p><p>New&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>19</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>35</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1500</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>35</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>110</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>"
